<title>UK: RUGBY UNION-SOUTH AFRICA A WIN 29-13.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-SOUTH AFRICA A WIN 29-13.</headline>
<dateline>GATESHEAD, England 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa A beat the North of England 29-13 (halftime 17-13) in a rugby union tour match on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
